  "notes": [
    "titan1 has ONE Observing_System containing two <name> children (Spectrometer 1, Spectrometer 2). Per rule 6, OS2 (Observing_System<2>/name<1>) is '' because there is no second Observing_System; only the first system's second name would be name<2>, which is not a selected column.",
    "cal_b, img0004 START = 0002-01-01 (nil missing); img0002, titan2 START = 0003-01-01 (nil unknown); spec02 START = 0001-01-01 (nil inapplicable).",
    "overview START is a present-but-empty <start_date_time></start_date_time> element -> '' (distinct from a nil element, which substitutes). plain, jup03, spec04 have no Time_Coordinates element at all -> also ''.",
    "img0007sub file basename (img0007sub.lblx) differs from its LID product token (img0007_subframe_alpha); FILE_NAME uses the basename, LID uses the logical_identifier text.",
    "overview LID has collection token 'document' but bundle_name (4th colon token, index 3) is still 'stress' for every label.",
    "Whitespace collapse applied to titan2 title (irregular internal spaces) and to multiline comments in ence1, img0003, spec03, overview; leading padding on spec03/img0003/overview comment lines is stripped after collapse.",
    "geom/rings elements are namespaced; METHOD/FRAME come from geom:Geometry and RING/FEATURE from rings:Ring. jup03 has geom:reference_frame but no geom:method -> METHOD='' , FRAME='IAU_JUPITER'. ence2/spec02 have ring_name but no feature_type -> FEATURE=''."
  ]
}
